menu "Johnny Castaway milestone"

config JOHNNY_QEMU
    bool "Use the ESP32-S3 QEMU virtual RGB panel"
    default n
    help
        Replace only the Waveshare panel, CH422G, I2C and GT911 board access
        with Espressif's virtual RGB panel. Resource decoding and rendering
        remain unchanged.

config JOHNNY_QEMU_HEADLESS
    bool "Skip virtual LCD refresh waits in headless QEMU"
    depends on JOHNNY_QEMU
    default n
    help
        Keep framebuffer rendering active but do not notify the QEMU display
        device when no display frontend exists. The QEMU LCD component waits
        indefinitely for an absent frontend in -nographic runs.

config JOHNNY_BOARD_TEST
    bool "Show color bars and touch cursor only"
    default n
    help
        Skip Sierra data validation and INTRO.SCR decoding.

config JOHNNY_REVIEW_ONLY
    bool "Play only scenes saved as REVIEW"
    default n
    help
        Filter the active scene list to identities stored in the persistent
        REVIEW mask. OK removes the current identity; REVIEW retains it.
        Keep this disabled for the immutable 63-scene classification build.

config JC_SCENE_NAMES
    bool "Include curated Johnny scene names"
    default y
    help
        Include the offline generated ADS/tag friendly-title and future menu
        metadata curated from johnny-castaway.com and canonical resource data.
        Disable only when measuring the small flash cost of the name table.

endmenu
